work of Claymoon, which also passively effect the environment in the space in which they are shown.</p><p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1078\">For further information on pricing and availability for Adam’s work, please contact<br data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1046\"><strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1078\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"mailto:info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1076\">info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk</a></strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cbb9cb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9cbb9cb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a1acae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8a1acae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"978\" height=\"1262\" src=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Adam-Weissman-Golden-Earth-Studio.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4340\" alt=\"Adam Weissman - Golden Earth Studio\" srcset=\"https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Adam-Weissman-Golden-Earth-Studio.png 978w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Adam-Weissman-Golden-Earth-Studio-232x300.png 232w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Adam-Weissman-Golden-Earth-Studio-794x1024.png 794w, https://goldenearthstudio.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Adam-Weissman-Golden-Earth-Studio-768x991.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 978px) 100vw, 978px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"fal